        "@id": "https://bimsaarthi.com/ontology/v0/wbsPlannedCost"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@value": "Rollup: sum of governed <https://w3id.org/iprok/billing#BOQItem> amounts at a work package, rolled up the tree to the root. In Slice 1 this is COMPUTED ON READ in list_wbs_nodes (never persisted) — always-correct and it sidesteps a Fuseki/TDB2 quirk deleting xsd:decimal triples. The property + optional SHACL stanza are reserved for a future slice that may persist a snapshot."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@value": "WBS planned cost (rollup)"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"
      }
    ]
  },
